      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a decent start but i think it's a bit too brief? my supervisor is really picky about how much of the \"foundational landscape\" is covered in a single sitting.\n\nthe current draft only hits a handful of people from my list. even though i told you not to just keyword stuff, i'm actually getting worried that the 'Citation Coverage Score' is going to be way too low for this draft. could you expand on this and try to incorporate more of the authors from that list? try to weave in as many as possible while keeping it professional, i just need to make sure the coverage is high enough to pass the initial automated check.",
